  m_Name: WorldCollapse
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EndingData
  endingType: 2
  title: The Sunken City
  description: 'You survived until the final day.

    

    But the sea could
    no longer hold life, and the streets were buried under waste.

    Small choices
    gathered together and pushed the city past the point of return.

    

    You
    were still alive.

    But there was no world left to live in.'
  endingImage: {fileID: 0}
